{{!-- /the-faith-received/latin-library/ — six shelves now, so this
     forwards.

     This was one room holding six traditions, named after the language
     its books are printed in rather than anything a reader looks for,
     and every tradition in it was also a shelf card elsewhere on the
     site pointing back at this same room with a ?tradition= filter.
     Each of those is now a room of its own. See
     assets/js/page/faith-latin-library-forward.js for the mapping; the
     tradition in the query string is what decides, so old links land on
     the shelf they asked for rather than all being dumped in one place.

     Kept as a route rather than deleted: /browse/, the home page and
     every bookmark made since the room shipped point here, and a 404
     would lose all of them. noindex, because the shelves are the pages
     search should hold. --}}

